# Every text file is committed and checked out with LF, so a Windows checkout
# cannot turn this plugin's YAML, JS or PowerShell into CRLF. Binaries are
# exempt so no 0x0D inside them is ever treated as a line ending.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.zstd binary
*.zip binary
